/Title (If the server fails to properly validate user input, it could read and display the contents of /etc/passwd. This is because the user-supplied input is appended to /uploads/, resulting in a path like /uploads/../../../../../etc/passwd. The ../ sequences traverse back five directories from /uploads/, ultimately potentially reaching the root of the file system, allowing access to /etc/passwd.)
